# Code owners

# Reviewers are requested automatically when a pull request touches these paths.
# Requires "Require review from Code Owners" to be enabled in branch protection —
# see BRANCH_PROTECTION.md.
#
# Replace the placeholder handle with a real maintainer's GitHub username, and add
# more handles after a comma where several people share an area. GitHub picks the
# *last* matching rule, so the specific entries at the bottom deliberately override
# the broad `*` catch-all above them.

# Default: anything not matched below.
